  "bodyHash": "FAfCRRyT36M=",
  "content": "<h1>午夜觸發者的默認連接紋理附加包</h1><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CelestialAbyss/badges/refs/heads/main/fusion/requires/cozy_vector.svg\" alt=\"需要Fusion\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmt-ct-d-a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"可在Modrinth取得\"></a></p><h4>此資源包的目標是為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mt-ct-d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MT-CT-D</a>添加附加包，並按照此處<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmedia.forgecdn.net%252fattachments%252f760%252f188%252fscreenshot-2023-11-16-183130.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">截圖</a>所示的順序載入資源包</h4><h2>附加包有哪些？</h2><ul>\n<li>CG - 透明玻璃</li>\n<li>NT_CG - 透明玻璃，但染色玻璃保持不變</li>\n<li>PA - 程式師美術風格</li>\n<li>F32 - 與<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Faithful32</a>相容的FCT相容包</li>\n<li>F64 - 與<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Faithful64</a>相容的FCT相容包</li>\n</ul><h2>常見問題</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mt-ct-d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MT-CT-D</a>頁面有常見問題解答，附加包的相關內容大多在此處</li>\n<li>請確保載入順序如同此處<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmedia.forgecdn.net%252fattachments%252f760%252f188%252fscreenshot-2023-11-16-183130.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">截圖</a>所示（附加包在之後載入）</li>\n</ul><h2>GitHub資訊</h2><ul>\n<li>此項目已與MT-CT-D的GitHub合併，問題回報也一併整合，請註明您使用的版本。附加包的名稱前綴為「Addon_」</li>\n<li>您可在此處找到GitHub倉庫<a href=\"https://github.com/Midnighttigger/MT-CT-D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a></li>\n</ul><h2>法律資訊</h2><ul>\n<li>除另有說明外，保留所有權利。允許用於模組包及YouTube等影片中使用</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
